  1	//! Local-network ("LAN" / iPhone-hotspot) SSH Git server.
  2	//!
  3	//! Lets a desktop machine host its notes repository over an embedded SSH server
  4	//! with QR-based key pairing, so a phone on the same Wi-Fi or hotspot can
  5	//! clone/pull/push without an external remote, macOS Remote Login, or
  6	//! plaintext `git://`.
  7	//!
  8	//! Hosting requires the `git` command-line binary for `git-upload-pack` /
  9	//! `git-receive-pack` and is desktop-only; on mobile the commands report
 10	//! `supported = false`.
 11	
